<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes<br />
<strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article<br />
<strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Horror<br />
<strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> Standard SCP Article</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Elevator&nbsp;Pitch</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;me</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> SCP-XXXX called (Midnight sun) according to those who have seen it is a:<br />
Secured, Contained, Protected Large 45&#160;m dark aquatic life form ,similar in appearance to any one of the following : the prehistoric lizard mosasaurs, cephalopod, whale, shark, turtle, crocodile or generally any large aquatic based lifeform. It presents a significant cognitohazard, physically viewing it without experiencing its effects(Will expand later) are almost impossible.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Central&nbsp;Narrative</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;me</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong><br />
Story will focus around it's history and unsuccessful attempts by the foundation to try and contain it. History will focus upon the discovery of SCP not by the foundation but by a German Kreigsmarine Captain/Naval Historian pre ww2, upon the chance discovery of the accounts of Spanish Armada survivors during his service to the nationalist side navy in the Spanish Civil war. The accounts of these survivors leads captain asking German High command(GHC) to investigate site upon the accounts which state 2 Spanish ships were destroyed by a creature in the Atlantic ocean. Said captain investigates with a secretly designed u boat called the K version with 90 men. Boat is destroyed and he is the only survivor (Will describe what happened to crew and how captain survived later), he later absconds form his duty living his life in Switzerland during the war, GHC assume he is dead. SCP foundation finds out about him when they discover Ships logs on a sunken u boat where the SCP is contained (SCP found because of a previous incident). When foundation confronts him they discover 6 things: 1.Captain is very old but looks relatively young 2. He named the SCP leviathan der Mitternachtsonne(leviathan of the Midnight sun) first viewing it during a blood moon 3.He had struck a deal with the SCP because he understood the promise<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-343999-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-343999-1')">1</a></sup> 4. All who see it will describe it differently with one exception 2 eyes, 7 pupils in each staring at you 5. It is innocuous for everyone until it isn't 6. It his burden and his burden alone to appease the SCP for it had shown him what it truly was.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The Foundation who at great expense contained it realised the SCP was capable of Salinity conversion<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-343999-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-343999-2')">2</a></sup>during their encounters<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-343999-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-343999-3')">3</a></sup>, which if left uncheck can cause cataclysmic change in weather, flora/fauna, and cause an unknown chain of butterfly effects potentially leading to extinction level event.</p>
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">Footnotes</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-343999-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-343999-1')">1</a>. Something known only to the captain</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-343999-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-343999-2')">2</a>. changing the salinity of water to make it saltier or more like fresh water</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-343999-3"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-343999-3')">3</a>. This ability was caused not by the foundation or the captain but by someone else (the promise is defective)</div>
</div>

